{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Chambers</strong> is a poker-inspired roguelike deckbuilder where every battle is decided by the hand you choose to play. Using traditional Texas Hold\u2019em rules, you speculate between six possible hands\u2014each showing only one face-up card\u2014and weigh the risk of how much damage a losing hand could cost you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to unlock new cards and abilities that let you manipulate the board, manage risk, and tilt the odds in your favor. Your deck is your edge: use it to weaken rival hands while strengthening your own, shaping each round to swing the game toward your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/55aed5c7518f432f00effee52388f318.poster.avif?t=1761183799\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/55aed5c7518f432f00effee52388f318.webm?t=1761183799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/55aed5c7518f432f00effee52388f318.mp4?t=1761183799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/b557c94950cc673f1420dd545870e3a3.poster.avif?t=1761183799\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/b557c94950cc673f1420dd545870e3a3.webm?t=1761183799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/b557c94950cc673f1420dd545870e3a3.mp4?t=1761183799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c